  "title": "class as sugar",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## A route blueprint\n\n`class Route { constructor(dir) { this.dir = dir } go() { Player.move(this.dir) } }` is nicer spelling for prototype methods.\n\n`go` lives on `Route.prototype`. Two instances share the same function.\n\nThe fox builds `new Route(\"east\")` and calls `go` three times. The heading lives on the instance; the walk method is shared."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "class-proto",
      "promptMd": "`new Route(\"east\").go === new Route(\"east\").go` is…",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "false",
          "md": "false — each instance gets a new go"
        },
        {
          "id": "true",
          "md": "true — go lives on Route.prototype"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "true"
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "id": "go-lives",
      "kind": "cloze",
      "promptMd": "`go` lives on {{a}}.",
      "blanks": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "Route.prototype",
              "md": "Route.prototype"
            },
            {
              "id": "each instance",
              "md": "each instance"
            },
            {
              "id": "the global object",
              "md": "the global object"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "a": "Route.prototype"
      },
      "explainMd": "class methods are prototype methods. Instances share one go function."
    },
